{'symbol': 'CSGP', 'date': '2019-10-21 22:30:00', 'title': 'COSTAR GROUP, INC. REPORTS EARNINGS RESULTS FOR THE THIRD QUARTER ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2019', 'text': 'COSTAR GROUP, INC. ANNOUNCED EARNINGS RESULTS FOR THE THIRD QUARTER ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2019. FOR THE THIRD QUARTER, THE COMPANY ANNOUNCED SALES WAS USD 352.808 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 305.525 MILLION A YEAR AGO. OPERATING INCOME WAS USD 94.269 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 70.688 MILLION A YEAR AGO. NET INCOME WAS USD 78.619 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 58.759 MILLION A YEAR AGO. BASIC EARNINGS PER SHARE WAS USD 2.16 COMPARED TO USD 1.63 A YEAR AGO. DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE WAS USD 2.15 COMPARED TO USD 1.61 A YEAR AGO. FOR THE NINE MONTHS, SALES WAS USD 1,024.993 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 876.261 MILLION A YEAR AGO. OPERATING INCOME WAS USD 262.561 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 167.907 MILLION A YEAR AGO. NET INCOME WAS USD 227.036 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 154.825 MILLION A YEAR AGO. BASIC EARNINGS PER SHARE WAS USD 6.26 COMPARED TO USD 4.3 A YEAR AGO. DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE WAS USD 6.2 COMPARED TO USD 4.25 A YEAR AGO.'}